  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Executive Leadership Development 3</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective is to support the Central Bank of Libya (CBL) with strengthening the administrative cooperation between the separate regional branches of CBL (west/Tripoli, east/Benghazi and south/Sabha) and further to contribute to the reunification process of CBL.The focus lies on developing strategic succession policies and enhancing both internal and external communication skills for second-line managers and individuals in roles with management potential within CBL. There is special emphasis on gender equity and on ensuring women have equal access to management positions. This initiative is a follow-up collaboration with CBL following the success of the initial tailor-made training in 2023.</narrative>
  </description>
